- roll for 3star Rakan on bench if you have enough space otherwise just sell him;
- later you want to have 5 3stars for the bonus true damage from Solar;
- only go for 1 ARTIFACT from Ornn Quest (passive) since 2 ARTIFACTs take too long -> swap items to Leona3 as main tank later;
